{
  "description": "Integrate StarRocks as a supported BenchBox platform. StarRocks is an open-source\nMPP columnar OLAP database (Linux Foundation project) with strong performance\ncharacteristics and growing enterprise adoption (11K+ GitHub stars, used by\nAirbnb, Alibaba, Coinbase, Pinterest, Tencent).\n\nTechnical fit analysis confirms:\n- SQLGlot has official 'starrocks' dialect support (verified working)\n- MySQL protocol connectivity via PyMySQL (port 9030)\n- Full TPC-H (22 queries) and TPC-DS (99 queries) compatibility\n- Competitive performance vs ClickHouse, Trino, Druid in benchmarks\n- Multiple data loading options (Stream Load HTTP API, INSERT+FILES())\n\nStrategic value:\n- Fills gap in modern MPP OLAP coverage alongside ClickHouse\n- Enables independent TPC-H/TPC-DS verification (vs vendor-published results)\n- Native data lake support (Iceberg, Hudi, Delta Lake) enables lakehouse benchmarks\n- Growing market adoption makes this relevant for users\n\nReference: Comprehensive analysis completed in conversation on 2026-01-07.",
